    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2269" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀϊδωνεύς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έως
			</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έος</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>AP</u>
			7.480
		</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
			Leon.
		</span></i>)), ὁ, lengthd. poet. form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄιδης</span>, twice in <i><span class="en">
			Hom.
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Il.
			5.190
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			20.61
		</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
			Hes.
			<u>Th.</u>
			913
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			A.
			<u>Pers.</u>
			650
		</span></i> (lyr.); prob. scanned <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Αἰδωνεύς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					1560
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.): gen. and dat. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀ̄ῐδονῆος,
				-ῆι</span> in later poets, <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				6.490
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				30.172
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Αἰδωνῆος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Mosch.
					4.86
				</span></i>
			:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀιδωναία</span></b> , ἡ, epith. of Hecate, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Par.</u>
				1.2855
			</span></i>.</div>
